@startuml
title WebSocket Connection State Machine
left to right direction
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

state "DISCONNECTED" as Disconnected
state "CONNECTING" as Connecting
state "CONNECTED" as Connected
state "RECONNECTING" as Reconnecting
state "STOPPED" as Stopped

[*] --> Disconnected
Disconnected --> Connecting : valid session available
Connecting --> Connected : connection succeeds
Connecting --> Reconnecting : connection fails
Connected --> Reconnecting : connection interrupted
Reconnecting --> Connected : retry succeeds
Reconnecting --> Reconnecting : retry after delay
Connecting --> Stopped : session invalidated
Connected --> Stopped : logout or token invalid
Reconnecting --> Stopped : logout or token invalid
Stopped --> Disconnected : new valid login

note bottom of Reconnecting
After reconnection, reload current API data
when missed events are possible.
end note
@enduml
